<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>बाबा पुरन्द्रनाथ युवा दल - पुरंदरपुर</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;600;700&family=Tirop+Devanagari&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; scroll-behavior: smooth; }
        .hindi-font { font-family: 'Tirop Devanagari', serif; }
        .bhagwa-bg { background-color: #FF9933; }
        .dark-blue { background-color: #1A237E; }
        .tab-content { display: none; }
        .tab-content.active { display: block; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 text-gray-800">
    <nav class="dark-blue text-white sticky top-0 z-50 shadow-2xl p-4">
        <div class="container mx-auto flex justify-between items-center">
            <h1 class="font-bold text-xl hindi-font">🔱 बाबा पुरन्द्रनाथ युवा दल</h1>
            <a href="#donate" class="bhagwa-bg px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-bold">DONATE</a>
        </div>
    </nav>
    <section class="relative h-[60vh] flex items-center justify-center text-center text-white bg-slate-800">
        <div class="z-10 px-4">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2 hindi-font">हर हर महादेव</h2>
            <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold mb-4 text-orange-400 hindi-font">बाबा पुरन्द्रनाथ युवा दल</h1>
            <p class="text-sm tracking-widest uppercase">पुरंदरपुर, सिवान (बिहार)</p>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="container mx-auto px-4 -mt-10 relative z-20 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-center">
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow-lg border-b-4 border-orange-500"><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase">Total Donation</p><h3 class="text-xl font-bold">₹ 1,52,500</h3></div>
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow-lg border-b-4 border-red-500"><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase">Total Expense</p><h3 class="text-xl font-bold">₹ 85,200</h3></div>
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow-lg border-b-4 border-green-500"><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase">Balance</p><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-600">₹ 67,300</h3></div>
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow-lg border-b-4 border-blue-500"><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase">Members</p><h3 class="text-xl font-bold">51+</h3></div>
    </section>
    <footer class="dark-blue text-white py-10 mt-20 text-center">
        <p class="hindi-font text-xl mb-4">संपर्क: पुरंदरपुर, गोरेयाकोठी, सिवान</p>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">© 2024 बाबा पुरन्द्रनाथ युवा दल</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
